  "body": "## Goal\nMake forward bases and contested clash zones explicit in the approved one-base / three-branch planning board.\n\n## Confirmed visual grammar\nEach branch reads: Ward Citadel home base → Ward forward base → contested clash zone → Veil endpoint.\n\nForward bases are route outposts, not extra home bases. Clash zones are live Ward-vs-Veil contact nodes, not generic route decorations.\n\n## Scope\n- v3 planning visualization and its current canon records\n- Current consumer evidence alignment only\n- No Godot code, Scene, Resource, or runtime asset replacement\n\n## Acceptance\n- All three branches visibly contain a forward base and a clash zone.\n- The single Ward Citadel topology remains intact.\n- The planning-board/runtime boundary remains explicit.",
